-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Невестино</span><span class=\"num\">6,9<!-- -->% · <!-- -->62</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Златица</span><span class=\"num\">6,9<!-- -->% · <!-- -->156</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Варна</span><span class=\"num\">6,7<!-- -->% · <!-- -->10 214</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Чипровци</span><span class=\"num\">6,4<!-- -->% · <!-- -->111</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Шабла</span><span class=\"num\">6,3<!-- -->% · <!-- -->109</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Априлци</span><span class=\"num\">6,2<!-- -->% · <!-- -->85</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Елин Пелин</span><span class=\"num\">6,2<!-- -->% · <!-- -->572</span></li></ol></div><div><p class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Най-слаби общини</p><ol class=\"text-[15px] space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Джебел</span><span class=\"num\">0,4<!-- -->% · <!-- -->26</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Самуил</span><span class=\"num\">0,5<!-- -->% · <!-- -->15</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Момчилград</span><span class=\"num\">0,5<!-- -->% · <!-- -->44</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Борино</span><span class=\"num\">0,5<!-- -->% · <!-- -->8</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Сърница</span><span class=\"num\">0,5<!-- -->% · <!-- -->14</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Доспат</span><span class=\"num\">0,6<!-- -->% · <!-- -->23</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Крумовград</span><span class=\"num\">0,6<!-- -->% · <!-- -->59</sp